<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="<%= currentLang %>"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Qəbz | ShopNexus</title><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.2/css/all.min.css"><style>@media print{.no-print{display:none!important}.receipt{box-shadow:none!important;border:0!important}body{background:#fff!important}}</style></head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900"><div class="no-print"><%- include('../partials/navbar',{user:user||null}) %></div><main class="px-4 py-10"><section class="receipt mx-auto max-w-2xl rounded-3xl border bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-8"><header class="flex flex-col gap-5 border-b border-dashed pb-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between"><div><p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-teal-700">ShopNexus qəbzi</p><h1 class="mt-1 text-2xl font-black"><%= receipt.reference_number %></h1><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500"><%= new Date(receipt.created_at).toLocaleString('az-AZ') %></p></div><span class="self-start rounded-full bg-emerald-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-black text-emerald-700"><%= receipt.status %></span></header>
<div class="grid gap-3 border-b border-dashed py-6 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2"><div><span class="text-slate-500">Əməliyyat</span><p class="font-black"><%= receipt.operation_type %></p></div><div><span class="text-slate-500">Ödəniş üsulu</span><p class="font-black"><%= receipt.payment_method||'—' %></p></div><% if(receipt.order_id){ %><div><span class="text-slate-500">Sifariş</span><p class="font-mono font-bold">#<%= receipt.order_id.slice(0,8) %></p></div><% } %><% if(receipt.card_last4){ %><div><span class="text-slate-500">Kart</span><p class="font-black"><%= receipt.card_brand||'Kart' %> •••• <%= receipt.card_last4 %></p></div><% } %><% if(isOwner&&receipt.customer_name){ %><div><span class="text-slate-500">Müştəri</span><p class="font-black"><%= receipt.customer_name %></p></div><% } %><% if((receipt.merchant_names||[]).length){ %><div><span class="text-slate-500">Satıcı</span><p class="font-black"><%= receipt.merchant_names.join(', ') %></p></div><% } %></div>
<% if((receipt.items||[]).length){ %><div class="space-y-3 border-b border-dashed py-6"><% receipt.items.forEach(item=>{ %><div class="flex justify-between gap-3 text-sm"><span><%= item.name %> × <%= item.quantity %></span><b><%= money(item.line_total) %> ₼</b></div><% }) %></div><% } %>
<div class="space-y-2 py-6 text-sm"><% if(receipt.subtotal){ %><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-slate-500">Ara cəm</span><b><%= money(receipt.subtotal) %> ₼</b></div><% } %><% if(receipt.discount){ %><div class="flex justify-between text-emerald-700"><span>Endirim</span><b>-<%= money(receipt.discount) %> ₼</b></div><% } %><% if(receipt.wallet_contribution){ %><div class="flex justify-between"><span>Cüzdan hissəsi</span><b><%= money(receipt.wallet_contribution) %> ₼</b></div><% } %><% if(receipt.card_contribution){ %><div class="flex justify-between"><span>Kart hissəsi</span><b><%= money(receipt.card_contribution) %> ₼</b></div><% } %><% if(receipt.refund_amount){ %><div class="flex justify-between text-rose-700"><span>Geri qaytarma</span><b><%= money(receipt.refund_amount) %> ₼</b></div><% } %><div class="mt-3 flex justify-between border-t pt-3 text-xl"><span class="font-black">Cəmi</span><b><%= money(receipt.final_total) %> ₼</b></div></div>
<div class="grid items-center gap-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-4 sm:grid-cols-[160px_1fr]"><img src="<%= qrDataUrl %>" alt="Qəbz doğrulama QR kodu" class="mx-auto h-40 w-40"><div><h2 class="font-black">Qəbzi doğrula</h2><p class="mt-1 break-all text-xs text-slate-500"><%= receiptUrl %></p><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400">Bu görünüş yalnız oxuma üçündür. QR-də tam kart və ya giriş məlumatı yoxdur.</p></div></div><button onclick="window.print()" class="no-print mt-6 w-full rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 py-3 font-black text-white"><i class="fa-solid fa-print mr-2"></i>Çap et / PDF</button></section></main><div class="no-print"><%- include('../partials/footer') %></div></body></html>
